OL,5,G0800 Radcliffe and Maconie
OL,6,     FMark and Stuart present a feast of
OL,7,     Fgreat music and chat for weekend
OL,8,     Fbreakfast.
OL,9,G1000 Cerys Matthews
OL,10,     FCerys welcomes Lina Palera to
OL,11,     Fexplore ancient Greek music, soil
OL,12,     Fecologist Frank Ashwood on the
OL,13,     Fhidden world beneath our feet, and
OL,14,     FJason Singh on the wonder of
OL,15,     Fstarling murmurations.
OL,16,G1300 Bobby Friction's Finest Hour
OL,17,     FBobby Friction brings his
OL,18,     Fgenre-hopping musical taste to
OL,19,     FSunday afternoons.
